explanation:
Item analysis is a statistical review of test questions after administration. It is used to find out:
- the **facility (difficulty) index**: how easy or hard each item is;
- the **discrimination power**: whether the item separates high scorers from low scorers;
- the **effectiveness of distractors**: whether the wrong options attract weaker students.

As all three are the focus of item analysis, the answer is **all of the above** (option D).
